---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "News"
seoTitle: "Ohio Family Law News: Custody, Support & Court Rules"
summary: "Bills, rule changes, appellate decisions, and agency data affecting Ohio domestic relations and juvenile courts."
type: page
---
{% from "partials/card.njk" import card with context %}
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>News</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ summary }} Every item is dated, sourced, and labeled. News does not editorialize.</p>
    <p class="meta-line"><a href="/news/feed.xml">Atom feed</a></p>
  </header>
  <div class="card-list">
    {% for item in collections.news %}
      {{ card(item) }}
    {% else %}
      <p class="empty">No news items yet.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>